Rozan :airplay:alac (Apple Lossless decoder)

This module contains a Kotlin port of the decoder in Apple's ALAC reference
implementation (codec/ALACDecoder.cpp, ag_dec.c, dp_dec.c, matrix_dec.c,
ALACBitUtilities.c and ALACAudioTypes.h from
https://github.com/macosforge/alac).

